          "summary": "The negative binomial regression was fit with a default alpha=1.0 instead of estimating the dispersion parameter, invalidating the overdispersion model. QA artifacts are empty, descriptive statistics are missing, and reporting is inadequate. The study cannot support any claims.",
          "findings": [
            {
              "id": "F1",
