              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Without a test for overdispersion (e.g., Cameron & Trivedi’s test, AER dispersion test), the choice of NB over Poisson is unjustified, and model fit cannot be evaluated.",
              "actionableFix": "Provide a formal test for overdispersion (e.g., dispersion test in R `glm` vs `glm.nb`), report deviance, and compare AIC/BIC with a Poisson model.",
